# Example output files and folders (generated by running examples)
Examples/**/*.md
Examples/**/*.txt
# ...but not the dependency list the Dockerfile and the CI workflow install from
!Examples/requirements.txt
Examples/**/output/
Examples/**/content/
Examples/**/images/

